  "guid": "com.vultify.nvgsightdimmer",
  "name": "NVG Sight Dimmer",
  "slug": "nvg-sight-dimmer",
  "teaser": "Automatically dims sight and scope brightness when your NVGs are on — no more blinding reticles.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/DamNKeh0omvDbcgIFfY3Ho9Kf8FuK5dJWM5WG9sV.jpg",
  "downloads": 3935,
  "favourites_count": 32,
  "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Automatically dims sight and scope reticle brightness when night vision goggles (NVGs) are active, preventing the reticle from blooming/washing out your view.</p>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Automatically detects when NVGs are turned on and dims sight brightness</li>\n<li>Two independent F12 config sliders — one for holo/red-dot sights, one for magnified scope reticles</li>\n<li>Toggle to enable/disable auto-dimming entirely</li>\n<li>Brightness automatically restores to normal when NVGs are turned off</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Install Instructions</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Extract the archive</li>\n<li>Drop the <code>BepInEx</code> folder into your SPT root directory</li>\n<li>Press <strong>F12</strong> in-game to adjust brightness sliders if needed</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Known Limitations / Bugs</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>ACOG-style prisms and scopes (e.g. Monstrum Compact Prism 2x32, TAC30) have their reticle baked into the lens as static art rather than a separate adjustable element, so their brightness cannot currently be adjusted by this mod.</li>\n<li>The HHS-1 hybrid sight’s flip-up magnifier has no reticle of its own — it magnifies the existing holographic dot, which is dimmed correctly by the holo slider, but doesn’t reflect properly.</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Support</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Found a bug or have a question? Leave a comment on this mod’s page, or reach out in my thread on the SPT Discord: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://discord.com/channels/875684761291599922/1521972310595338260\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://discord.com/channels/875684761291599922/1521972310595338260</a></p></div></div></div>\n",
